A||||34||Richard Parnell||Which model is the coolest looking Fiero?||||1||
Z||000000||Richard Parnell||12-15-1999||02:30 PM||||This should stir up the pot a bit.  I love the way the GTs and fastbacks look.  They're cool, but I love the refined smooth lines of my SC.  The way the front end rolls under with the spoiler attached underneath really strikes my sense of style just right.  The GTs and others look great with spoilers but I think would "spoil" the lines of the SC.  We should get a topic going that has pictures of all the different styles of Fieros, showing the unique facets of each.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Eric||12-15-1999||02:46 PM||||I like the look of the GTs too.  I saw a few at the Nationals that really looked good.  The ones that were lowered and had big aftermarket wheels were my favorite (maybe I just have a little rice in me).  I'd like my car to be as attractive.  I don't have a wing or a lowered suspension or cool wheels, but I still like my GT better than any other model Fieros.||||reg||1
