Z||000017||WKDFIRO||12-16-1999||06:12 AM||||At the time I had first my 87 coupe I really liked the nose and rearend treatment that it had for that year. ESPECIALLY in the Med Red Metallic (Burgandy). But it did not have a spoiler. After it was destroyed I got an 85 GT and decided to create a Formula style that I could play with. Its black with the front and rear Formula facias with the GT cladding on the door and lower portions of the fender-door-fender. I still think that I will finish it up and go with the coupe running boards but it looks great. <P>So I would have to say that my favorite style would be the Formula. It may not be as aerodynamicly functional as the GT but it still makes me smile when I walk towards it in the parking lot!||||reg||6
