Z||000022||DXR_DAD||12-16-1999||09:43 PM||||I love my 86SE. The lines on this care are MONSTER!! the front end (aero), The notch back/semi-fastback (quarter windows)looks good. my car is black and at night when the light hits it just right I can look at it all night with those polished wheels, the deck lid scoop, after market rear spoiler. Ok thats enough Iam going outside to look at it right now!!!<P>But now I have a 87 coupe and I like the front and rear fascias, but still a notchback||||reg||1
